<p>Ah, &quot;as long as you are right.&quot; There's the self-obsessed, grandiose righteousness I've come to expect. Pleasing people in chat is narrow. Being big and great means knowing how to please people you don't even know yet. But as long as everyone is happy, it's not my place to criticize the end goal. I'm merely saying this path and this end goal is not my cup of tea.</p>
<p>I do think a lot of stuff here does qualify as &quot;intelligent writing&quot; as you say&#8230; but in my head there's a lot of intelligent writing here that gets bombed over petty rules and pet peeves that really don't matter. Again, it's y'alls community as you make it. Self-determination is a right. It's just not me. Be well.</p>
